  "description": {
    "text": "Five English promos from the partnership of The Football Association and The Pokémon Company International, in place since September 2019, around futsal and The FA Pokémon Youth Futsal Programme. Each card shows a Pokémon \"on the Ball\" and carries a Pokémon Futsal stamp, numbered 001/005 to 005/005.\n\nFour were gifts with Pokémon TCG purchases at GAME stores in England, released one at a time, from Eevee in September 2020 to Sobble in September 2021, with Grookey and Scorbunny in between, along with a futsal-themed card holder. Youth clubs that registered for the program had a chance to receive the fifth, Pikachu, which GAME announced as a store gift in 2022.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "PokéGuardian: Pikachu on the Ball Will Be Available in Game UK Stores (and the earlier Futsal promo posts)",
        "url": "https://www.pokeguardian.com/923966_pikachu-on-the-ball-will-be-available-in-game-uk-stores"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A football symbol at the bottom left, and a number out of 005",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "PokéGuardian: Pikachu on the Ball Will Be Available in Game UK Stores (and the earlier Futsal promo posts)",
        "url": "https://www.pokeguardian.com/923966_pikachu-on-the-ball-will-be-available-in-game-uk-stores"
      }
    ]
  },
